WEBVTT

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:04.660
I mean it... Stay with me!

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:07.560
I swear I'll keep you safe.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:10.030
Hugo?

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.260
Yuzu?

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:14.860
Yuzu!

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.260
Yuya...

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.420
I get to see Yuya again, too?

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.570
Now it's your turn.

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:33.750
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:37.820
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:41.250
Their dragons call to each other,

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:44.550
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:22.990
Shura's Bloodlust

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:26.780
Yuya! I found your father!

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:35.270
Do you remember me?

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:39.520
I could never forget you.

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:42.270
All this time, I've been waiting for you.

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:43.580
You're...

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.450
Kachidoki!

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:53.050
Ever since I lost to you,

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:55.990
I've spent my days in deepest darkness.

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.340
At Ryozanpaku School,

00:02:58.340 --> 00:03:03.370
I was effectively expelled for 
disgracing our combat duels.

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:19.210
Do you want to beat Yuya Sakaki?

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:23.200
He will come eventually to 
the Fusion Dimension.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:23.920
How about it?

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:26.920
And so, I came here...

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:31.860
To defeat you, and crawl free of 
the days of deepest darkness!

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:36.530
Well, Kachidoki, I'll leave the rest to you.

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:37.740
Dennis!

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:40.730
Hey! It's been a while, Gonny!

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:42.080
You...

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:46.000
You were involved in the kidnapping 
of Kurosaki's sister, Ruri.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.910
Are you here to kidnap Yuzu, too?

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.550
Answer him!

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:52.440
And tell us where Serena is, too.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:56.510
Sorry, but I have other business to attend to.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.180
Well, you handle the rest.

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:08.830
Hey! Wait!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.200
Kaito!

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:14.400
Leave him to me!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.800
Hey, that isn't up to you.

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:18.500
Now, hand over Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.710
If you surrender her peacefully, 
we'll spare you.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:22.650
Yuzu!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:26.890
Get off me, Kachidoki! I don't 
have time to deal with—

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:28.450
Duel me.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:29.470
Yuya!

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:31.650
I won't let you have Yuzu!

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:36.140
Yeah, we can take care of 
small fry like you in no time.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:38.860
Yuya...

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.010
I'm fine.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:43.830
Gongenzaka's here, too. 
And I can fight for myself.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:46.060
So fight your own duel!

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.140
Yuzu...

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:49.530
Okay.

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:52.000
I accept your duel!

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.610
You intend to duel him?

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:04.170
Yeah, I think what happened 
to him was my fault.

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:07.910
Field Spell Crossover.

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.460
Duel!

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:12.900
I'll go first.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:16.260
I activate my spell card Polymerization

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:20.500
to fuse Kaiki the Unity Star and 
Hayate the Earth Star in my hand.

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:23.370
He who is one with the heavens.

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:26.460
He who flies over the earth.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:30.980
Become one and shine as the 
eternal conquering star!

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:33.550
Fusion Summon.

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:37.920
Come, Level 10 Idaten the Conqueror Star!

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:41.620
That's the monster he used...

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:45.750
I set one card and end my turn.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:50.200
Now, hurry and call it out.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.730
That vile Xyz Dragon...

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:56.080
He seems to hold quite a grudge.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:06:00.710
I wanted to refute his violent way of dueling.

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:04.700
But... That time, I think I was the one...

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.110
My turn!

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:11.870
I set the Pendulum Scale

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:16.380
with Scale 3 Xiangke Magician and 
Scale 8 Xiangsheng Magician!

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:22.660
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 4 and 7 simultaneously!

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:25.630
Swing, my soul's pendulum...

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:28.220
Draw a shining arc in the sky!

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:30.330
Pendulum Summon!

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:32.980
Appear, my monsters!

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:38.810
Level 4 Performapal Salutiger!

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:42.150
Level 4 Performapal Whip Snake!

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:45.520
Level 5 Performapal Drummerilla!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:49.130
I don't want to hurt anyone 
with a duel ever again.

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:51.610
Not like that time...

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:57.060
I overlay Level 4 Salutiger and Whip Snake!

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:01.630
From the black darkness,

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:06.540
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:08.940
Xyz Summon!

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:13.130
Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:18.860
I activate Dark Rebellion's effect.

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:24.290
I use one Overlay Unit to halve Idaten's 
attack points until the end of the turn,

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:27.610
and increase Dark Rebellion's 
by the same amount.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:29.290
Treason Discharge!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.870
That's how you won last time, but...

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:40.440
When the attack points of a Fusion Monster 
on my side of the field decrease,

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:43.540
I can Special Summon Kaiki the 
Unity Star from my graveyard!

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:51.400
What happened?

00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:58.060
You... Your face...

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:01.800
When I successfully Special 
Summon Kaiki the Unity Star,

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:06.760
I can pay 500 life points to Fusion Summon 
without a Polymerization card.

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:07.960
What?

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:11.970
The curse of he who is one with the 
heavens will lead me to victory.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:16.670
I fuse Kaiki the Unity Star and 
Idaten the Conqueror Star!

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:18.740
He who is one with the heavens.

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.320
Eternal conqueror.

00:08:22.010 --> 00:08:24.820
Unite your powers, and reign 
over heaven and earth!

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:27.150
Fusion Summon.

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:31.390
Come, Level 12 Shura the Combat Star!

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.830
A Level 12 Fusion Monster?

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:39.540
As long as Shura the Combat 
Star is on the field,

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:43.210
the attack points of all other 
monsters are reduced to 0.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:45.510
Reduced to 0?

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:49.240
Shura the Combat Star has one more effect.

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:51.580
When a monster does battle,

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:56.140
the attack points of both monsters are 
increased by 200 times their levels.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:58.920
But your dragon has no level.

00:08:58.920 --> 00:08:59.650
Yes!

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:03.750
Having no level means it is Level 0!

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:08.300
Your dragon's attack points will not increase!

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:11.840
But as long as Shura is on the field,

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.830
Fusion Summoned through Kaiki's curse,

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:19.800
I take 500 points of damage during 
each of my Standby Phases.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:27.230
After spending days in deepest darkness 
I finally acquired this power...

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:29.880
To plunge you into true darkness.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.180
Darkness?

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:34.850
With this curse's power, I will defeat you!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.630
He's willing to kill himself to obtain that power.

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:41.830
Because I was swallowed 
by darkness back then,

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:44.330
and I was unable to save Kachidoki.

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:50.000
But I'm not the same way I was then, either!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:54.440
I activate Xiangke Magician's Pendulum Effect!

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:58.490
Once per turn, I can give Dark 
Rebellion Xyz Dragon

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:01.780
a level equal to its rank!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:12.600
What?

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:15.590
You can give a level to a monster without one?

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:19.360
And Xiangsheng's Pendulum Effect

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:23.840
sets Dark Rebellion's level 
equal to Shura's Level 12!

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:35.250
Battle! Dark Rebellion attacks Shura!

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:37.720
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:42.270
Shura's effect increases the attack 
points of monsters doing battle

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:44.420
by their level times 200.

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:47.530
Drummerilla's monster effect activates!

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:50.170
Once in each of our Battle Phases,

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:53.430
it can increase the attack points of 
one monster in battle by 600!

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:56.360
What?

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:04.710
Action Spell Choice Choice!

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:07.480
I can negate the destruction 
of a monster by battle

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:10.310
or halve the damage dealt.

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:13.230
I choose to negate the destruction.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.690
But you still take damage.

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:23.780
When the Battle Phase ends, 
Drummerilla's effect ends!

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:26.930
Shura's effect ends, as well.

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.670
Now, do it!

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:30.760
End your turn already!

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:33.970
I set a card and end my turn.

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:37.850
And in that instant, the effect that gives 
Dark Rebellion its level ends.

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:40.880
My turn!

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:50.560
Kaiki's curse means I take 
500 points of damage...

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:54.390
You've put yourself in that much danger...

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:59.290
The more Kaiki's curse eats into me,

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:01.230
the closer it brings me to victory.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:08.310
I equip Shura with my spell 
Shooting Star Sword!

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:11.130
Once per Battle Phase,

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:14.880
when the equipped monster destroys another, 
with an equal or lower level, by battle,

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.650
it can attack twice!

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:17.850
What?

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:18.720
Battle!

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:22.290
Shura attacks Drummerilla!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:25.260
If it's destroyed, Dark Rebellion 
won't be far behind.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:36.490
Shura's effect increases the attack 
points of the monsters doing battle

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:38.170
by their level times 200!

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:44.310
Drummerilla's effect increases the attack 
points of one monster doing battle by 600!

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:46.840
Action Spell Charge Recklessly!

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:51.370
The attack points of one monster 
doing battle increase by 600.

00:12:57.470 --> 00:13:01.390
In that instant, Shura's effect and 
the Action Spell's effect end,

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:03.840
and all attack points return to normal.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:06.330
But Shura, by destroying the 
lower-leveled Drummerilla,

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:10.840
gets one more attack, through its 
equipped Shooting Star Sword.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:14.540
I attack Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:20.580
Once again, Shura's effect increases its 
attack points by its level times 200!

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:27.390
What?

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:38.800
Action Spell... Restore!

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:41.720
For this turn, I can restore 
the original attack points

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:45.140
of one monster whose attack 
points have been altered...

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:51.580
Its attack points are back!

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:54.050
Action Spell Double Attack!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:58.150
During the Battle Phase, I double 
one monster's attack points.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.720
The attack points are reversed again!

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:13.430
There!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:16.370
Action Spell Evade!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.730
I negate an attack against one monster!

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:22.810
I end my turn.

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:25.860
I managed to protect it...

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:29.880
Did you plan it that way?

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:31.050
No.

00:14:31.960 --> 00:14:33.250
This is taking all I have.

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:41.790
What's all the noise?

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.050
It sounds like a duel.

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.270
You'd better not lose, Yuya!

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:49.080
Sawatari! Focus on the duel!

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:50.000
But...

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:52.970
They've stopped, too.

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:55.440
My turn!

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:57.340
Yes!

00:14:57.340 --> 00:15:02.430
I use the Pendulum Scale set 
with Scale 3 and Scale 8

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:03.680
to Pendulum Summon!

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:07.920
Return from my Extra Deck, 
Performapal Drummerilla!

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:11.660
And from my hand, Performapal Pyrobster!

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:12.860
Another one?

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:14.520
Pendulum Summon!

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:17.260
And this time, he brought one 
back from his Extra Deck?

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:22.600
Xiangke Magician's Pendulum Effect 
gives Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:25.670
a level equal to its rank, 4!

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:29.310
Then, Xiangsheng Magician's 
Pendulum Effect

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:32.680
sets Dark Rebellion's level to 12, 
the same as Shura's.

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:36.000
But with Shooting Star Sword equipped,

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:39.750
Shura can't be destroyed by a monster with 
a level lower than, or equal to, its own.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.990
I activate Dark Rebellion's effect!

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:46.970
I use one Overlay Unit to halve 
Shura's attack points

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:49.590
and increase Dark Rebellion's by that amount!

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:53.440
But their attack points are 0!

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:55.460
What was the point of that?

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:58.570
I was thinking of shooting off a big firework.

00:15:58.570 --> 00:15:59.940
Firework?

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:04.140
I activate the monster effect of 
Performapal Pyrobster!

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:09.850
I set Shura's level to the total levels of the 
two Performapals in my graveyard!

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:13.760
You used the Overlay Unit

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:16.320
because you needed two 
Performapals in your graveyard?

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:17.720
That's right...

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:21.990
Now, what's the combined level of 
Performapals in my graveyard?

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.830
Oh, yeah!

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:28.870
8!

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:35.440
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:39.780
Now, after we enjoy the fireworks, 
it's time for battle, naturally!

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:42.250
Dark Rebellion attacks Shura!

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:46.010
Shura's effect increases the attack points 
of the monsters doing battle

00:16:46.010 --> 00:16:48.420
by their levels times 200!

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:54.560
Drummerilla's effect increases the attack 
points of one monster doing battle by 600!

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:01.430
Damn. Where is it?

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:02.820
An Action Card...

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:07.060
There aren't any left.

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:10.360
Have I been abandoned by fate, as well?

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:16.150
Continuous Trap Radiance 
of the Forbidden Spell!

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:20.100
I halve my own life to activate it!

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:25.680
I render all my empty Monster Zones unusable

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:31.180
to increase one monster on my field's attack 
points by the number of zones times 800!

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:43.840
After battle ends, I set all monsters on your 
side of the field to defense position,

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:47.180
and destroy my monster that was affected 
by Radiance of the Forbidden Spell.

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:49.720
Yuya Sakaki,

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.650
I swore that I would beat you.

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:55.020
Ever since you beat me...

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:58.060
No, eight years before that...

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:00.660
Since that day I passed you at the riverside!

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:03.860
I'm sure you don't remember.

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:08.000
You, having fun dueling in the sun.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:12.170
And I, walking the dark path 
at the Ryozanpaku School.

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:15.470
Now I know for sure!

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:18.610
This is the way that I must die!

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.580
What do you mean, die?

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:23.050
Radiance of the Forbidden Spell's other effect!

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:26.000
After the Battle Phase ends,

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:30.720
both players receive damage 
equal to the number

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:33.160
of Monster Zones it rendered 
unusable times 500!

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:34.850
What?

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:36.730
2000 damage to both?

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:37.860
A tie?

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:40.120
I will not permit myself to lose.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:43.980
Thus, I will end this duel with my death!

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:48.170
Kachidoki!

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:52.540
Yuya!

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:54.440
I activate my trap!

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:55.750
Acrobatic Tower!

00:18:56.090 --> 00:18:58.080
I tribute one Performapal!

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:05.290
Yuya!

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:12.230
What's going on?

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:15.300
It means the Battle Phase isn't over yet.

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:18.730
The fun is only getting started!

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:34.730
What is this?

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:37.820
This is the tower of destiny, Acrobatic Tower!

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:41.530
I call four monsters from 
each of our graveyards.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:44.840
Plus the one on the field, which makes nine.

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:48.700
Such an all-star cast will create 
today's highlight!

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:52.720
Both players draw two cards from their decks.

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:57.260
Based on the monster cards we draw, 
it will fall one way or the other,

00:19:57.260 --> 00:20:00.680
dealing damage equal to the number 
of monsters times 200!

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:03.240
Victory that's decided by draws?

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:07.710
Interesting. I accept your challenge!

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:10.280
Now, it's time for the moment of destiny!

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:11.660
Draw!

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:17.960
Then, we'll send our draw 
card to the graveyard.

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:20.930
And we'll unveil...

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:22.540
the first cards!

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:27.120
The first ones are Performapal Hip 
Hippo and Hayate the Earth Star.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.610
And the monsters' levels are?

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:35.120
Now, which way will the tower fall?

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:37.080
Time for the second draw of destiny!

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:46.410
The second draw is Performapal Bit 
Bite Turtle and Tenma the Sky Star.

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:47.980
The monsters' levels?

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:54.460
Oh! The tower's really starting to sway...

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:57.200
It's like it can't withstand the 
weight of their levels.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.820
Which side is heavier?

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:04.940
That's thirteen total monsters.

00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:08.380
In other words, you take 
13 times 200 damage.

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:10.780
The end...

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:17.830
I lost again.

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:22.030
My duel with you was really fun.

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:23.720
Fun?

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:29.780
See? Everyone's happy.

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:48.980
You scared me at the end there...

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:51.540
An entertainment duel, eh?

00:21:53.050 --> 00:21:54.410
It isn't bad.

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:04.840
You really are an entertainment 
duelist to an idiotic degree.

00:23:50.170 --> 00:23:52.680
You really fooled me back there.

00:23:52.680 --> 00:23:54.750
Let's finish things now, teacher.

00:23:54.750 --> 00:23:56.520
I accept that duel!

00:23:56.520 --> 00:23:57.650
Who are you?

00:23:57.650 --> 00:24:01.720
After I beat you, you must 
show me where Ruri is.

00:24:01.720 --> 00:24:03.650
There's no way that's happening!

00:24:03.650 --> 00:24:07.860
But defeating a student in front of his 
teacher would be entertaining...

00:24:07.860 --> 00:24:09.690
So sure, I'll fight you.

00:24:10.290 --> 00:24:14.630
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Great Galaxy Shining in Darkness.

00:24:14.950 --> 00:24:17.000
The fun is only getting started!
